flowchart TD
    IN["Derivation inputs<br/>wage structure and component tags<br/>DOJ, DOB, engagement type<br/>establishment mapping and its coverage facts<br/>declared statutory attributes"] --> CTX["Evaluation context<br/>period derived · as-of decision time<br/>jurisdiction set: work-location state and sphere<br/>scheme version in force for the period"]
    CTX --> RV{"Rule version resolved<br/>for this period and jurisdiction?"}

    RV -->|"No row sourced for the state or period"| UND["UNDETERMINED<br/>readiness reason raised<br/>no default, no guessed slab"]
    RV -->|"Resolved"| COV{"Establishment covered<br/>for this scheme?"}

    COV -->|"Not notified or below the line"| NC["NOT_COVERED_ESTABLISHMENT<br/>re-derives on a later crossing<br/>or a later notification"]
    COV -->|"Covered"| TEST["Apply the scheme test<br/>on the period's wage base<br/>and the master facts in force"]

    TEST --> OPT{"Does the rule object<br/>expose an option?"}
    OPT -->|"Yes and one is recorded"| OVR["Option applied<br/>maker-checked, own effective range<br/>named in the explainer"]
    OPT -->|"No option, or none recorded"| STD["Statutory branch applied"]

    OVR --> LATCH{"Latch or stickiness<br/>in force for this period?"}
    STD --> LATCH
    LATCH -->|"Yes"| CONT["LATCHED_CONTINUING<br/>range stays open until the<br/>latch's own exit condition"]
    LATCH -->|"No"| OUT["ELIGIBLE or NOT_ELIGIBLE<br/>as the branch decided"]

    CONT --> EXP
    OUT --> EXP
    NC --> EXP
    UND --> EXP
    EXP["Derived range written with its explainer<br/>inputs and their values · rule version and citation<br/>branch taken · option and its approver · decided-at"]
    EXP --> CONS["Consumers<br/>§08 engine · readiness report<br/>registers · inspection evidence export"]

    NOEDIT["No hand edit anywhere on this path.<br/>A disagreement is fixed at an input<br/>or at the rule object, then re-derived."]
    EXP -.- NOEDIT
